note Stored receive bytes not yet delivered (marks in Trmap).
fn cmapused to ulong
n = ulong 0
for i ulong 65536
if ne get Trmap i 0
n = add n 1
end
end
ret n
end
note Write n bytes of our stream from offset off (cpat from Cy 11); returns the count taken.
fn cwr off ulong n ulong to ulong
for i ulong n bound 65536
put Tapp i cpat add get Cy 11 add off i
end
ret twrite n
end
note Send n bytes from offset off, then t ms later the peer acknowledges them all.
fn crtt off ulong n ulong t ulong to void
m = cwr off n
tstep cnow
put Cx 6 add cnow t
o = cfeed cfr 16 cseq 0 sadd get Cx 1 add off n 0 0
end
